{
  "name": "TU/e preferred file formats",
  "source": "TU/e Research Data Management, 'Data Organization & Formats', table of preferred formats (rdm.tue.nl/docs/during-research/data-organization/, read 2026-10-03). Not on that list but added, following it: .docx, .pptx, .xlsx and .xlsm, the newer formats that replace the .doc, .ppt and .xls the list advises against, as preferred; Markdown, tab-delimited text and code saved as plain text (R, MATLAB scripts, Stata, SPSS syntax, ...) as plain text; binary data files of R (.rds, .rda), statistics packages (.sav, .dta, ...) and Python (.pkl, .npy) under 'other binary files'; .geojson for GeoJSON, .mkv for Matroska video, .dgn for MicroStation and .blend for Blender (the list writes .mka, .dng and .blender).",
  "formats": {
    "pdf": {
      "level": "preferred",
      "label": "PDF/A",
      "alternative": "PDF/A",
      "requires": "pdfa",
      "unmet_label": "PDF (not PDF/A)"
    },
